WEBVTT

00:07:57.973 --> 00:08:00.267
discouraging them from accessing care.

00:08:01.018 --> 00:08:02.186
Now --

00:08:03.270 --> 00:08:06.440
I am very, very, very proud

00:08:06.482 --> 00:08:09.026
to lead the Tackle HIV campaign.

00:08:09.527 --> 00:08:11.403
And we focus on that first point,

00:08:11.403 --> 00:08:12.780
education.

00:08:12.780 --> 00:08:14.615
And along with our charity partners,

00:08:14.615 --> 00:08:16.367
the Terrence Higgins Trust

00:08:16.367 --> 00:08:17.535
and ViiV Healthcare,

00:08:17.576 --> 00:08:22.122
which is an organization fully focused
on eradicating HIV and AIDS,

00:08:22.122 --> 00:08:26.085
we are using the power
of science, advocacy and sport

00:08:26.126 --> 00:08:28.045
to change people's attitudes.

00:08:28.379 --> 00:08:31.257
We draw on the ability of sport
to effect change,